WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.538
Variational inference dominates thanks to
amortization: one shared encoder predicts the latents for all data.

00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:12.966
But it relies on tractable Gaussians, limiting accuracy.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:17.789
MCMC has no such limit, yet nobody truly amortized
it before.

00:00:17.869 --> 00:00:21.980
The goal: amortized efficiency with MCMC flexibility.
